    <briefdescription>
<para>Used for dynamically loading instances of <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_inline_order" kindref="compound">InlineOrder</ref> as plugins. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Plugins must implement an <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_plugin_inline_order_analysis_1a6f63aac075f4dbf0570c39aa982d1daf" kindref="member">InlineOrderFactory</ref>, for an example refer to: llvm/unittests/Analysis/InlineOrderPlugin/InlineOrderPlugin.cpp</para>
<para>If a <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_plugin_inline_order_analysis" kindref="compound">PluginInlineOrderAnalysis</ref> has been registered with the current <ref refid="namespacellvm_1af9c9208365fd9ce11392b4d79485e259" kindref="member">ModuleAnalysisManager</ref>, <ref refid="namespacellvm_1a7acaa9d2987b3c0842cc1a758bfcb0d0" kindref="member">llvm::getInlineOrder</ref> returns an <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_inline_order" kindref="compound">InlineOrder</ref> created by the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_plugin_inline_order_analysis" kindref="compound">PluginInlineOrderAnalysis</ref>&apos; Factory. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
